msgstr ""
"Pertama, kita mulai dengan sebuah sirkuit yang terinspirasi dari Gambar 1(a)"
" dalam [arXiv:2302.03366v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.03366v1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-"
"move-instruction/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-"
"move-instruction/output_1.png)\n"

