#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create observable to go with the new circuit {#create-observable-to-go-with-"
"the-new-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Buat observable yang sesuai dengan Circuit baru {#create-observable-to-go-"
"with-the-new-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This observable corresponds with `observable`, but we must account correctly"
" for the extra qubit wire that has been added (i.e., we insert an \"I\" at "
"index 4).  Note that in Qiskit, the string representation qubit-0 "
"corresponds to the right-most Pauli character.\n"
msgstr ""
"Observable ini berkorespondensi dengan `observable`, tetapi kita harus "
"memperhitungkan dengan benar jalur qubit ekstra yang telah ditambahkan "
"(yaitu, kita menyisipkan \"I\" pada indeks 4). Perlu diingat bahwa dalam "
"Qiskit, representasi string qubit-0 berkorespondensi dengan karakter Pauli "
"paling kanan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Separate the circuit and observables {#separate-the-circuit-and-observables}"
msgstr ""
"Pisahkan Circuit dan observable {#separate-the-circuit-and-observables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As in the previous tutorials, qubits sharing a common partition label will "
"be grouped together, and non-local gates spanning more than one partition "
"will be cut.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti dalam tutorial sebelumnya, qubit yang berbagi label partisi yang "
"sama akan dikelompokkan bersama, dan gate non-lokal yang mencakup lebih dari"
" satu partisi akan dipotong.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
