#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-"
"sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr ""
"Hitung overhead pengambilan sampel untuk potongan yang dipilih {#calculate-"
"the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut two wires, resulting in a sampling overhead of $4^4$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini kita memotong dua wire, menghasilkan overhead pengambilan sampel "
"sebesar $4^4$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the "
"[explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang overhead pengambilan sampel yang "
"ditimbulkan oleh circuit cutting, lihat [materi "
"penjelasan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-"
"subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr ""
"Hasilkan subeksperimen untuk dijalankan pada Backend {#generate-the-"
"subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts `circuits`/`observables` args as "
"dictionaries mapping qubit partition labels to the respective "
"`subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`generate_cutting_experiments` menerima argumen `circuits`/`observables` "
"sebagai kamus yang memetakan label partisi qubit ke "
"`subcircuit`/`subobservables` masing-masing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many "
"subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint "
"quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The"
" number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by "
"`num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample."
" For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the "
"[explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mensimulasikan nilai ekspektasi Circuit berukuran penuh, banyak "
"subeksperimen dihasilkan dari distribusi kuasiprobabilitas gabungan gate-"
"gate yang didekomposisi dan kemudian dieksekusi pada satu atau lebih "
"Backend. Jumlah sampel yang diambil dari distribusi dikontrol oleh "
"`num_samples`, dan satu koefisien gabungan diberikan untuk setiap sampel "
"unik. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang cara koefisien dihitung, lihat "
"[materi penjelasan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend {#choose-a-backend}"
msgstr "Pilih sebuah Backend {#choose-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we are using a fake backend, which will result in Qiskit Runtime "
"running in local mode (i.e., on a local simulator).\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini kita menggunakan Backend palsu (fake backend), yang akan "
"mengakibatkan Qiskit Runtime berjalan dalam mode lokal (yaitu, pada "
"simulator lokal).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prepare the subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-"
"the-backend}"
msgstr ""
"Siapkan subeksperimen untuk Backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-"
"backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We must transpile the circuits with our backend as the target before "
"submitting them to Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita harus men-transpile Circuit dengan Backend kita sebagai target sebelum "
"mengirimkannya ke Qiskit Runtime.\n"

